# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep local configuration and
# credentials out of the image. Every file copied into an image is public.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.git/
**/.github/
**/.devcontainer/
**/*.user
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.Local.*.json
**/appsettings.Test.json
**/secrets.json
**/*.slnx
**/launchSettings.json
docs/
*.md
!README.md
